    69	## 3.1 Integrated Voice Echo
    70	
    71	The voice application is an on-demand NSH builtin with no button dependency.
    72	`voice_echo` records exactly five seconds from I2S0, then plays the captured
    73	mono PCM through I2S1 and returns to NSH. The bounded record buffer is 160000
    74	bytes (`16000 * 5 * sizeof(int16_t)`). Playback uses the existing chunked
    75	16 kHz to 24 kHz 3:2 conversion without a second complete playback buffer.
    76	OLED updates are best-effort and never make audio fail.
