 46	    "Physical movement tool for the robot dog. Use only for explicit physical "
 47	    "requests to move forward, backward, turn left, or turn right. Do not use "
 48	    "it for figurative language, and never invent raw servo angles. The tool "
 49	    "waits for one POWER_SAFE motion request to complete; a busy robot rejects "
 50	    "the request.\","
 51	    "\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{"
 52	    "\"direction\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"forward\","
 53	    "\"backward\",\"left\",\"right\"]},"
 54	    "\"steps\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":1,\"maximum\":1},"
 55	    "\"period_ms\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":800,"
 56	    "\"maximum\":3000}},\"required\":[\"direction\"]}}]";
