  1282	  /*
  1283	   * Producer side from tts_pcm_playback_guide.md:
  1284	   *
  1285	   * Never fail a valid long utterance just because the 256 KiB ring is
  1286	   * temporarily full.  Wait for the dedicated playback worker to free space,
  1287	   * then continue writing the same PCM chunk.
