 694	/* The generic ESP32-S3 helper splits a 4096-byte RX request into 4095+1.
 695	 * With the I2S RX EOF unit used by this board, that layout can terminate
 696	 * after the first short descriptor.  Keep RX descriptors 4-byte aligned and
 697	 * use two equal buffers for the normal 4096-byte transaction.
